  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 201.01 Form and Content. The written appeal of an employing unit or employer who claims to be aggrieved by a determination made under RSA 282-A:94, shall set forth in detail the specific facts which constitute the basis of its case and/or argument as to the law.\n\nSource. #2234, eff 1-1-83; ss by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90\n\nNew. #5140, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRES: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-05\n\nNew. #8469, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06\n\nNew. #8626-A eff 5-6-06",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
